# Every module Tiny Core's unmodified config-6.12.11-tinycore64 builds (paths
# below lib/modules/6.12.11-tinycore64/kernel/). That's more than they ship in
# XXRI's set (tc-modules-x86_64.list). A module of XXRI's build that is missing
# here exists only because of sof-x86_64.config, so
# scripts/xxri-sound-modules.py sends it to xxri-sound.tcz.
# Regenerate when the kernel source or Tiny Core's config changes: build the
# unmodified config (make modules) and list the *.ko.
